  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: Intransitive verb (⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧). No transitive pair exists.\n\nCONJUGATION: Ichidan verb\n- {錆|さ}びない (negative)\n- {錆|さ}びます (polite)\n- {錆|さ}びて (te-form)\n- {錆|さ}びた (past)\n\nUSAGE:\n⟦{腕|うで}→腕：01006_ude⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{錆|さ}びる (skills become rusty) - Used for abilities that have deteriorated from lack of practice.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{錆|さび}→錆：03887_sabi⟧ - rust (noun)\n- {錆|さ}びつく - to rust solid, to seize up with rust\n\nWRITING:\nThe kanji ⟦{錆|さび}→錆：03887_sabi⟧ is specific to rust. It may also be written in hiragana as さびる.\n\nREGISTER:\nNeutral. Common in everyday conversation.",
